  "content": "<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>欢迎来到樱之国度，这款融合了竹子、WA和枫树元素的模组。</strong></span>\n\n ![](https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/XmQ8N1SBjJKhFy6.png)\n\n<span style=\"font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\">本模组充满日式风情，包含定食、寿司以及丰富多样的美食。</span></span>\n\n<span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\">使用你的武士刀和小太刀体验全新的战斗方式，通过篝火和烹饪锅制作料理。</span>\n\n<span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\">手持武士刀的新型灾厄村民会在竹林和枫林中生成！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\">新服饰：着物、浴衣和羽织。</span>\n\n \n\n<span style=\"font-family: 'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;\">尽情享受吧~</span>\n\n \n\n#### **官方宣传片：**\n<iframe width=\"634\" height=\"354\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eaTCFOl_YyQ\" title=\"Minecraft Sakura mod official PV\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n \n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\">截图展示：</span></strong></span>\n\n<img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/aoQGLIkAwTb5z9s.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1519\" height=\"792\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/g8k9wzsUV7ZBpAn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1114\" height=\"580\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/7N4ioG1OHFQwtb2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/i8OR6hEB2IXyDHA.png\">",
